  ⚠ Remaining incompatibilities noted by connector LLM:
    - aiohttp has no synchronous client API; aiohttp.ClientSession() cannot be substituted for requests.Session() without an async event loop context.
    - ScadaClient.get_demand/get_runtimes/command are synchronous methods with synchronous callers; making the underlying HTTP calls async would require 
