        and amqtt are all MQTT client libraries that could serve the same functional role (publishing MQTT messages), and the file's own docstring explicitly 
        calls out aiomqtt as a substitution target for paho-mqtt. However, these alternatives are async-first (asyncio-based, often using async context 
        managers), whereas the current code is fully synchronous (MqttSink.publish is a plain sync method).

